    <div class="section wBC50AE" id="sec-legal">
      <div class="section-content">
        <div class="row b3E689A large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed">
          <aside class="column b02D6FD large-12 medium-12" aria-labelledby="comp" role="complementary">
            <div class="row i563145 large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
              <span class="column a46D232 large-12"><h2 class="copy y8F69A5 channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" id="comp" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span id="footnote-diamond-1" aria-hidden="true">◊</span>Legal Disclaimers</h2></span>
            </div>
            <ul class="d89BA0D" role="list">
              <li class="p28561A" role="listitem">
                <div class="row x23907D large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column z950A68 large-12"><p class="copy v7D7B09 channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Accessories:</span> Accessories are sold separately and are subject to availability. Compatibility varies by model and generation. USB-C to Apple&nbsp;Pencil Adapter is required to work with iPad&nbsp;(A16).</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="b88D254" role="listitem">
                <div class="row mE7D9CE large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column lB58318 large-12"><p class="copy iA417B8 channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 100%)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Apple&nbsp;Intelligence and Siri&nbsp;AI:</span> 
                      Apple&nbsp;Intelligence is available with Siri and device language set to Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional), Danish, Dutch, English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese, Spanish, Swedish, Turkish or Vietnamese. Some features may not be available in all regions or languages. Some devices may not be available in all regions. Siri&nbsp;AI is available in beta 
                      in iPadOS&nbsp;27 and requires an Apple&nbsp;Intelligence–enabled device set to a supported language. Available in English, French, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese and Spanish to start. Siri&nbsp;AI will not be initially available in the EU on iPadOS. Siri&nbsp;AI is not available for users under 13. Certain Apple&nbsp;Intelligence features that rely on server-side models are subject to daily usage limits, including but not limited to Siri&nbsp;AI, Intelligent Photo Editing 
                      Tools, Image Playground and AFM 3 Cloud models in Shortcuts. Daily limits may vary by feature, request complexity, system demand, system policies and other factors. Expanded access to such features will be available for a fee in the future. Use of these features is subject to the Apple&nbsp;Intelligence Terms and Conditions. Learn more at
                      <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-in/148587" class="footer-link">support.apple.com/en-in/148587<span style="color: #424245; white-space: nowrap"></span></a>.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="sKtUZDqu" role="listitem">
                <div class="row cJJjULzA large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column vJgXrLnG large-12"><p class="copy dJNBADst channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Apps:</span> 
                  Apps are available on the App&nbsp;Store. Title availability is subject to change. Procreate Dreams is available for purchase on the App&nbsp;Store.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="gTjuyvyc" role="listitem">
                <div class="row tnNrmppw large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column DhCRVFqD large-12"><p class="copy ymYElDtG channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Display:</span> The displays have rounded corners. When measured diagonally as a rectangle, the 13″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;Pro is 33.02&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(13″), the 12.9″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;Pro is 32.77&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(12.9″), the 11″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;Pro (M4 and M5) is 28.22&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(11.1″), the 11″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;Pro (1st–4th generation) is 27.96&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(11″), the 13″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;Air is 32.78&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(12.9″), the 11″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;Air and 11″&nbsp;iPad (A16) are 27.59&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(10.86″), the 10.9″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;Air and iPad&nbsp;(10th generation) are 27.58&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(10.86″), the 8.5″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;mini (A20 Pro) is 21.59&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(8.5″) and the 8.3″&nbsp;iPad&nbsp;mini (A17 Pro) is 21.08&nbsp;cm&nbsp;(8.3″). Actual viewable area is less. 
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="mphOXHWK" role="listitem">
                <div class="row IPRvwjHB large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column DGfXdBNb large-12"><p class="copy BAWgIGeQ channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Fast Charging:</span> Testing conducted by Apple in September 2026 using pre-production iPad&nbsp;mini (A20&nbsp;Pro) units, and USB‑C&nbsp;Charge&nbsp;Cable with Apple 40W Dynamic&nbsp;Power&nbsp;Adapter with 60W&nbsp;Max (Model&nbsp;A3351) or Apple 35W&nbsp;Dual USB-C&nbsp;Port Compact Power Adapter (Model&nbsp;A2571). Requires an outlet that supports up to 1.5A at 100–240V, 50–60Hz. Fast-charge testing conducted with drained iPad&nbsp;mini. 
                       Times measured from the appearance of the Apple logo as the unit started up. Charge time varies with settings and environmental factors; actual results will vary.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="TFzhlEqf" role="listitem">
                <div class="row yzHvZPAX large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column cbkgWctb large-12"><p class="copy Mkthbamj channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.5)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Feature Availability:</span> Some features may not be available for all countries or all areas. See&nbsp;<a href="https://apple.com/in/ios/feature-availability" class="footer-link">apple.com/in/ios/feature-availability<span style="color: #424245; white-space: nowrap"></span></a> for complete list.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="sqIZOZBH" role="listitem">
                <div class="row oQsljvvx large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column tbzWMCqX large-12"><p class="copy kkZRNHrD channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.5)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">5G:</span> Data plan is required. 5G is available in selected markets and through selected carriers. Speeds vary based on site conditions and carrier. For details on 5G support, contact your carrier and see&nbsp;<a href="https://www.apple.com/in/ipad/cellular/" class="footer-link">apple.com/in/ipad/cellular<span style="color: #424245; white-space: nowrap"></span></a>.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="sqIZOZBH" role="listitem">
                <div class="row oQsljvvx large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column tbzWMCqX large-12"><p class="copy kkZRNHrD channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.5)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">iCloud+:</span> Subscription is required. The Apple&nbsp;TV subscription included with iCloud+ does not include third-party branded subscription services or content available for rental or purchase in the Apple&nbsp;TV app. Some iCloud features require a Wi-Fi connection and are not available in all countries or regions. Access to some services is limited to 10&nbsp;devices.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="WrFVVevr" role="listitem">
                <div class="row kSdpstnn large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column xufnxmrr large-12"><p class="copy OCQIUAzJ channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.5)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Power and Battery:</span> Battery life varies by use and settings. See&nbsp;<a href="https://www.apple.com/in/batteries/" class="footer-link">apple.com/in/batteries<span style="color: #424245; white-space: nowrap"></span></a> for more information.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="BbLfJGuK" role="listitem">
                <div class="row XOTRpiBR large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column leOFFNwR large-12"><p class="copy oIVZYzpE channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Size and Weight:</span> Size and weight vary by conﬁguration and manufacturing process.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="PJgnhloC" role="listitem">
                <div class="row fhxuGyxd large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column tYkDgfur large-12"><p class="copy ljLWpcmf channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Storage Capacity:</span> Actual formatted capacity is less and varies due to many factors. Storage capacity is subject to change based on software version, settings and iPad model. 1GB&nbsp;=&nbsp;1&nbsp;billion bytes; 1TB&nbsp;=&nbsp;1&nbsp;trillion bytes.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="GzJqWsXD" role="listitem">
                <div class="row axPqqTcg large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column txruJjjh large-12"><p class="copy jOqMaysG channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Thinner and Lighter:</span> Compared with the previous generation.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="GHxquSBg" role="listitem">
                <div class="row UrfolDmD large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column yBfOIXzh large-12"><p class="copy LVuFRrnp channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Up to 2.7x Faster GPU, up to 1.6x Faster CPU:</span> Compared with iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(A17&nbsp;Pro). Testing conducted by Apple in September 2026 using pre-production iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(A20&nbsp;Pro) and production iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(A17&nbsp;Pro) units. CPU performance is based on iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(A20&nbsp;Pro) with 6-core CPU. Tested with Affinity&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;2&nbsp;v2.6.4 using the built-in benchmark version&nbsp;25000. Performance
                      tests are conducted using specific iPad units and reflect the approximate performance of iPad&nbsp;mini.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="ItLYWqqi" role="listitem">
                <div class="row MvUhtQgS large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column gGylFErG large-12"><p class="copy htLUiFWo channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Up to 4x Faster GPU, up to 2.2x Faster CPU:</span> Compared with iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(6th&nbsp;generation). Testing conducted by Apple in September 2026 using pre-production iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(A20&nbsp;Pro) and production iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(6th&nbsp;generation) units. CPU performance is based on iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(A20&nbsp;Pro) with 6-core CPU. Tested with Affinity&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;2&nbsp;v2.6.4 using the built-in benchmark version&nbsp;25000.
                      Performance tests are conducted using specific iPad units and reflect the approximate performance of iPad&nbsp;mini.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="PWsGNtzn" role="listitem">
                <div class="row xvTSRNAy large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column fwqyQpuF large-12"><p class="copy ngpoLlzw channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)">
                      <span style="font-weight: 500">Water and Dust Resistance:</span> iPad&nbsp;mini&nbsp;(A20&nbsp;Pro) is splash, water and dust resistant, and was tested under controlled laboratory conditions with a rating of IP67 under IEC standard 60529 (maximum depth of 1 metre up to 30 minutes). Splash, water and dust resistance are not permanent conditions. Resistance might decrease as a result of normal wear. Do not attempt to charge a wet iPad; refer to the user guide for cleaning 
                       and drying instructions. Liquid damage is not covered under warranty.
                    </p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="ENpHtYxv" role="listitem">
                <div class="row wevcziut large-display-bleed medium-display-bleed small-display-bleed">
                  <span class="column kIdCtSuh large-12"><p class="copy OGKmcFoW channel-custom-font-custom-12-sosumi" style="--focus-color: rgba(0, 125, 250, 0.6)"><span style="font-weight: 500">Wi-Fi 7:</span> Wi-Fi 7 is available in countries and regions where supported.</p></span>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
